; Simple counter example
; Demonstrates basic variable usage, conditionals, and control flow

## INIT_HANDLER
```
counter declare integer
max_value declare integer

; Initialize counter
0 varset counter
10 varset max_value

out "Counter initialized"
return
```

## INCREMENT_HANDLER
```
; Increment counter
$counter + 1 varset counter

out "Counter: " $counter

; Check if we've reached max value
$counter >= $max_value if overflow

goto exit

overflow:
    out "Counter overflow! Resetting..."
    0 varset counter

exit:
    return
```

## RESET_HANDLER
```
0 varset counter
out "Counter reset"
return
```
